---
description: Testing and regression discipline
globs: "**/*.py,tests/**,scripts/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

For behavior changes, add or update the narrowest regression test. Run relevant tests while iterating. Before a version is considered ready, run `./scripts/check_release.sh`. Never weaken a safety/security test merely to get green output; fix the implementation or update the test only when the intended behavior truly changed.
